        "The fifty minutes end without a knock. That is how you know Vale was watching: punctuality is his form of intimacy. Zero straightens the throw. You straighten your clothes. The generated park unpauses; the dog completes a catch that never happened. You feel, regardless of what you chose, as if a hand is still on your sternum. That is either chemistry or narrative. In this building they are the same department.\n\nZero stands at the fake window with their back to you, which is a courtesy. \"Last part,\" they say. \"The ask without sex on it. Stay converted if you have started. Start if you haven't. Let Helix own the rest. I can be the face you report to. I am kinder than Crowe and more finished than Maren and I will not pretend I can pull you out. I will pull you in. That is a cleaner promise.\"",
